codex
The edits are taking shape: Meren will get cheaper sacrifice outlets and reusable removal; Imotekh will move to 36 lands while keeping its useful sacrifice and graveyard engines. For Tazri, I’m adding Acererak and dungeon support while preserving all ramp, cheap party creatures, and Karlach’s extra combat synergy.
